* official Analog Canvas netlist; PDK X cards rewritten by convert.py
.model nch nmos
.model pch pmos

.subckt dut VDD VSS VIN VCONT2 VCONT3 VCONT4 VCONT5 VP VCONT1 VB4 VB1 VB2 VB3
.model DIODE D(IS=1e-14 N=1)
